{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "35", "x": 0.9032117274603759, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03053152114325986, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I want to watch this film again with my friend Rene, who's a real movie buff. She's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.8261860881224533, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "always had this knack for finding hidden cinematic treasures and has great taste", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1896453759080105, "w": 0.8267884222260566, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in arthouse films like this. With news of a big-screen re-release in China, we're", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21797572598214812, "w": 0.8265826546437703, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "planning to catch it in theatres.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24630607605628574, "w": 0.3209958904922766, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I've read several reviews online. Critics went wild over this film. Some called it \"a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2846114711659939, "w": 0.8259842164884117, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "meditation on modern life\", while others said it's \"too slow yet beautiful\". But", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.31294182124013153, "w": 0.826489869560577, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "everyone agrees the acting is next-level, especially in the final scene: tears flow", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3412721524535729, "w": 0.8263248043849513, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "silently as Hirayama drives to Feeling Good, a moment that embodies pure", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.8262351975753258, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cinematic magic.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39778456980788796, "w": 0.17641819949161977, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Why rewatch it with friends? Well, when I first watched it, I was just absorbing the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4360528470673654, "w": 0.8266373004441484, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "vibe. But since this film is layered like an onion, I want to catch those subtle details", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.46438319714150306, "w": 0.8262512939930732, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I missed, like how his daily routines shift almost invisibly. Plus, Rene and I always", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4927382924491278, "w": 0.8258594436196312, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "have deep conversations after watching such films. In a nutshell, this film is a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5210686802446579, "w": 0.8264303025624165, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "constant reminder to rethink our approach to life.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5493990303187956, "w": 0.5048633993399239, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "P3 answering ideas:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6257871888796128, "w": 0.21318780018665692, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "1.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6640925085465359, "w": 0.021371506039283665, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, to put it bluntly, modern local plays and stand-up comedy are", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6640925085465359, "w": 0.7791415006351934, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "absolutely dominating China's theatre scene right now. I mean, if you walk", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6924229340634586, "w": 0.7783796377034697, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "into any theatre in Shanghai, you'll find half the posters feature millennials'", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7206049636222435, "w": 0.7785024625981279, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "job burnout or dating disasters, all served with dark humour that hits too", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7489353136963811, "w": 0.77846668138925, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "close to home. Sure, Broadway musicals like Cats still sell out in big cities for", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7772657392133038, "w": 0.7785753578402831, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "their glamour, but the real hype is in shows that let people laugh through the", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8055960892874414, "w": 0.7789093841397793, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "hardships of life. Frankly, that's exactly the catharsis busy city dwellers crave", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8339264393615791, "w": 0.7786625040510172, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "these days.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8622815346692038, "w": 0.12017953298448193, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8906118847433414, "w": 0.025806094759918855, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "To be honest, getting theatre tickets in China is pretty straightforward these", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.8906118847433414, "w": 0.7786189309456502, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "days. You can still buy at the box office, but nowadays most people just book", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.9189423102602641, "w": 0.7788619150861676, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}